<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Wheatburn — the whole domain on one sitemap, because the marketing site and
  the shop share https://wheatburn.rw. This file is byte-identical in
  wheatburn-site/ and in wheatburn-shop/public/.

  Two deliberate choices:

  1. The marketing pages are listed with their .html extension. That project is
     plain static files with no rewrites configured, so /story.html is the URL
     that is certain to resolve. The shop is listed with clean URLs because its
     own server maps /menu to menu.html (see src/http.js).

  2. The shop's own home page is NOT listed. On a shared domain it would sit at
     "/", which the marketing home page already occupies, so it has no distinct
     URL yet. See the note in README.md before the site goes live.

  Only pages worth indexing appear here. /account, /order, /login, /register and
  the password pages are excluded and are blocked in robots.txt.
-->
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">

  <url>
